# Investment Portfolio Analytics Dashboard

> A Python-based portfolio analytics platform designed to evaluate portfolio performance, measure investment risk, visualize portfolio characteristics, and support data-driven investment decisions.

---

## Overview

This project develops a comprehensive portfolio analytics dashboard that evaluates historical investment performance using quantitative finance techniques and interactive visualizations.

The objective is to replicate the analytical workflow used by Portfolio Managers, Equity Research Analysts, Asset Managers, Wealth Managers, and Investment Analysts.

The dashboard provides meaningful insights into portfolio return, volatility, diversification, and risk-adjusted performance.

---

## Objectives

- Evaluate historical portfolio performance
- Measure portfolio risk
- Calculate risk-adjusted return metrics
- Analyse portfolio diversification
- Visualize portfolio allocation
- Build an interactive analytics dashboard
- Support investment decision-making

