---

## Portfolio Analytics

The dashboard evaluates:

### Performance Metrics

- CAGR
- Annual Return
- Cumulative Return
- Rolling Returns

### Risk Metrics

- Volatility
- Beta
- Maximum Drawdown
- Downside Deviation

### Risk-Adjusted Performance

- Sharpe Ratio
- Sortino Ratio
- Information Ratio
- Calmar Ratio

### Portfolio Analysis

- Asset Allocation
- Sector Allocation
- Correlation Matrix
- Diversification Analysis

---

## Dashboard Features

- Portfolio Performance Overview
- Historical Return Analysis
- Risk Analysis
- Allocation Charts
- Drawdown Analysis
- Correlation Heatmap
- Performance Comparison
- Interactive Visualizations

